# Extra inputs for requirements-lock.txt, on top of pyproject.toml's dependencies
# and its dev and tray extras. See requirements-lock.txt for the full command.
#
# hatchling is the bridge's build backend, and editables is what it asks for to
# build an editable install. Release builds install the bridge with
# --no-deps --no-build-isolation, so both come from the lock as well instead of
# being fetched unpinned into an isolated build environment.
hatchling
editables
